{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"scheme","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Scheme","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Scheme (.scm .ss .sld .sch).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"scheme","name":"Scheme","extensions":[".scm",".ss",".sld",".sch"],"grammar":"grammars/scheme.json","lineComment":";","blockComment":["#|","|#"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"Scheme","path":"snippets/scheme.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/scheme.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"#\\\\|\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\|#\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \";.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"#\\\\\\\\[A-Za-z0-9]+|'[A-Za-z0-9_\\\\-?!*<>=/]+\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"[()\\\\[\\\\]]\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:call-with-current-continuation|define-record-type|define-library|define-syntax|define-values|syntax-rules|let-values|quasiquote|letrec\\\\*|unquote|call/cc|define|lambda|letrec|unless|import|export|begin|quote|delay|force|let\\\\*|cond|case|when|set!|let|and|not|if|or|do)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:else|#t|#f)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:number->string|string-append|make-vector|for-each|display|newline|reverse|append|length|filter|reduce|vector|member|write|apply|assoc|read|cons|list|car|cdr|map)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/scheme.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Function\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"def\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"(define (${1:name} ${2:args})\",\n      \"  $0)\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A function\"\n  },\n  \"Let\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"let\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"(let ((${1:x} ${2:1}))\",\n      \"  $0)\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"let\"\n  },\n  \"Cond\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"cond\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"(cond\",\n      \"  (${1:test} ${2:result})\",\n      \"  (else $0))\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"cond\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Scheme\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Scheme.\n\n## Files\n\n`.scm`, `.ss`, `.sld`, `.sch`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `;`.\n- 3 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `def` | A function |\n| `let` | let |\n| `cond` | cond |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}